              "text": "देवरः — devaraḥ — \"a husband's brother\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मम देवरः चिकित्सकः अस्ति। mama devaraḥ cikitsakaḥ asti. My husband's brother is a doctor."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
